    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.diff\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nSigns misaligned with this config\r\n```lua\r\nrequire('mini.diff').setup({\r\n  view = {\r\n    style = 'sign',\r\n    signs = { add = '┃', change = '┃', delete = '_' },\r\n  },\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Neovim version\r\n\r\n0.10.2\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. `nvim -nu minimal.lua`\r\n2. `nvim {somefile}` in a git repo\r\n3. `ggO<CR>`\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nsigns aligned\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\r\nsigns misaligned\r\n\r\n<img width=\"530\" alt=\"Xnip2024-12-27_12-01-22\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea10f634-e5ef-46ec-97a4-9980b04106d5\" />\r\n",
