            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> Unfortunately, I can not reproduce. First, the reproduction steps most certainly need some custom value of 'signcolumn'. For example, `vim.o.signcolumn = 'yes:2'`. But even with that I can not reproduce.\r\n\r\nSorry, after my testing, `vim.o.signcolumn = 'auto:9'` is the key.\r\n\r\nThis is my minimal setup.\r\n```lua\r\nvim.o.signcolumn = 'auto:9'\r\nvim.opt.runtimepath:append{'/Users/eph/.config/nvim/pckr/opt/mini.diff'}\r\nrequire('mini.diff').setup({\r\n  view = {\r\n    style = 'sign',\r\n    signs = { add = '┃', change = '┃', delete = '_' },\r\n  },\r\n})\r\n```",
