            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be fixed on latest `main`.\r\n\r\nThe reason I was not able to reproduce it earlier is because I tested on Nightly (0.11) with `signcolumn=yes:2` which has order correct and correctly shows space for 2 signs (i.e. 4 cells). Testing with 0.10.3 indeed showed different order, while testing with `signcolumn=auto:2` showed the real issue of wider sign column than it should be.",
